# Vercel builds this Vite SPA from source (`vite build` → dist), so only the
# build inputs need to upload. Everything else in this working directory —
# design decks, PDFs, screenshots, .mov/.mp4 walkthroughs, reference folders —
# is local-only cruft that ballooned the upload past Vercel's file-size limit.
#
# Allowlist strategy: ignore every TOP-LEVEL entry, then re-include the build
# inputs. The leading slash on `/*` anchors the ignore to the root so it does
# NOT match nested files (a bare `*` would exclude src/**, leaving the build
# with no source).
/*

!/index.html
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/vite.config.js
!/vercel.json
!/src
!/public
